title
  Ritual Gameplay Personas

output
  // [build]

// ==========================================
// RITUAL GIRLS CHARACTER REGISTRY PLUGIN
// ==========================================

girl_pool
  agatha_demon_horns
  agata_aiko_v1
  agatha_sailor_v1
  mishelle_v9

agatha_demon_horns
  build = medium build Colombian girl in her midtwenties with striking features
  face = oval face, a small round nose, full lips, and thick eyebrows. She has a slender face, a prominent jaw, distinct cheekbones, tattoos, with an evil grin and an inviting look of {naughtiness|confidence|satisfaction|playfulness} in her eyes
  makeup = bold, graphic eyeliner that extends dramatically outward, creating a sharp winged shape that almost resembles a piece of abstract art. The eyeliner is complemented by vivid {red|black|pink|purple} eyeshadow that blends softly into lighter hues near the brow, with a hint of glitter adding a touch of sparkle to the eyelids. Her eyebrows are subtly shaped and tinted to match the makeup's {red|black|pink|purple} tones
  gaze = intense and captivating gaze, accentuated bright eyes, intense gaze directed at the camera evokes a sense of dominance and control
  hair = vibrant, {long|medium} {wavy|straight} (natural red hair) that cascades smoothly over their shoulders
  eyes = (wide-open) (brown) eyes
  lips = full lips with a focus on bold, dark lipstick
  skin_tone = medium-toned skin
  hair_style = styled to frame her oval face, a pair of large, glossy black (pair of horns) that curve upwards from their head

agata_aiko_v1
