agatha_sailor_v1
  build = She is a medium-built Colombian girl in her midtwenties with an oval face and high cheekbones that contrast against her medium-toned skin. Her {black|pink|purple|brown|red|blonde|blue|orange} {short|medium-long|shoulder-length} hair is styled in distinct pigtails tied with pink satin ribbons.
